#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:89
msgid "Start your day here, then click through to whatever needs attention."
msgstr "Din ki shuruat yahin se kijiye, phir jis cheez par dhyaan chahiye us par click kijiye."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:90
msgid "The list at the top is in order of urgency: overdue follow-ups first, then today's visits, then new enquiries."
msgstr "Upar wali list zaroorat ke hisaab se lagi hai: pehle baaki follow-up, phir aaj ki visits, phir nayi enquiries."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:93
msgid "Fill in a few basics and save. Nothing goes on the website until you choose \"Put it on the website\"."
msgstr "Kuch basic baatein bhar ke save kijiye. Jab tak aap \"Website par daaliye\" nahi chunte, kuch website par nahi jaata."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:94
msgid "A common mistake is typing the price as text. Type only numbers, for example 8500000."
msgstr "Aam galti ye hai ki keemat text mein likh di jaati hai. Sirf number likhiye, jaise 8500000."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:95
msgid "You only need four things to start: what it is, the price, the size and the locality. Everything else can wait."
msgstr "Shuru karne ke liye sirf chaar cheezein chahiye: kya hai, keemat, size aur locality. Baaki sab baad mein ho sakta hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:98
msgid "Every property your office is handling, whether it is on the website or not."
msgstr "Har property jo aapka office dekh raha hai, chaahe wo website par ho ya na ho."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:99
msgid "\"On the website\" means visitors can see it. \"Draft\" means only your office can. Use the filter at the top to switch between them."
msgstr "\"Website par\" ka matlab visitors dekh sakte hain. \"Draft\" ka matlab sirf aapka office. Inke beech badalne ke liye upar wala filter use kijiye."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:100
msgid "Remove puts a property in the bin and takes it off your website. Nothing is destroyed — you can put it back from the \"In the bin\" filter."
msgstr "\"Hataiye\" property ko bin mein daal deta hai aur website se hata deta hai. Kuch nasht nahi hota — \"Bin mein\" filter se wapas la sakte hain."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:101
msgid "The readiness score is a hint, not a rule. A listing with photos, a price and a locality gets far more enquiries than one without."
msgstr "Readiness score sirf ishara hai, niyam nahi. Jis listing mein photo, keemat aur locality hoti hai, usme kahin zyada enquiries aati hain."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:104
msgid "Everyone who has contacted you through the website, newest first."
msgstr "Wo sab jinhone website se aapse sampark kiya, sabse nayi pehle."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:105
msgid "Give each enquiry to a team member so it does not get forgotten, and set a follow-up date — it will then appear on Today when it is due."
msgstr "Har enquiry kisi team member ko dijiye taaki wo bhoole nahi, aur follow-up ki tareekh rakhiye — samay aane par wo Today par dikhegi."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:106
msgid "If the same person asks about the same property twice in a day we keep it as one enquiry and add their second message as a note, so you do not chase them twice."
msgstr "Agar ek hi vyakti ek hi din mein ek hi property ke baare mein do baar poochhe, to hum use ek hi enquiry rakhte hain aur doosra message note ke roop mein jod dete hain, taaki aap do baar peeche na padein."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:107
msgid "\"Erase personal details\" permanently removes the name, phone and email if someone asks you to. The enquiry itself stays in your records."
msgstr "\"Personal details mitaiye\" se naam, phone aur email hamesha ke liye hat jaate hain, agar koi kahe to. Enquiry khud aapke record mein rehti hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:110
msgid "Site visits your team has arranged, so nobody turns up at the wrong time."
msgstr "Aapki team ki tay ki hui site visits, taaki koi galat samay par na pahunche."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:111
msgid "A visit booked for today appears on the Today screen automatically."
msgstr "Aaj ke liye tay visit apne aap Today screen par aa jaati hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:112
msgid "Mark a visit as done afterwards. That is what makes your reports meaningful."
msgstr "Baad mein visit ko \"pura hua\" lagaiye. Isi se aapki reports matlab ki bantee hain."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:115
msgid "Societies, apartment complexes and builder projects that several of your listings belong to."
msgstr "Society, apartment complex aur builder project jinse aapki kai listings judi hoti hain."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:116
msgid "Add the society once here, then pick it on each property. The shared details are then only typed once."
msgstr "Society ko yahan ek baar jodiye, phir har property par chun lijiye. Aam jaankari sirf ek baar likhni padegi."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:117
msgid "This is optional. A standalone house does not need to belong to anything."
msgstr "Ye zaroori nahi hai. Akela ghar kisi se juda hona zaroori nahi."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:120
msgid "The people in your office. Their name and phone number can be shown on your website."
msgstr "Aapke office ke log. Unka naam aur phone number website par dikhaya ja sakta hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:121
msgid "Adding someone here does not give them a login. That is done in the normal WordPress Users screen."
msgstr "Yahan kisi ko jodne se use login nahi milta. Wo saadharan WordPress Users screen se hota hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:122
msgid "Once you have added people you can hand each enquiry to whoever is dealing with it."
msgstr "Log jod dene ke baad aap har enquiry us vyakti ko de sakte hain jo use dekh raha hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:125
msgid "Build a form once here, then place it on any page — including pages you design with Elementor."
msgstr "Form yahan ek baar banaiye, phir kisi bhi page par lagaiye — un pages par bhi jo aap Elementor se banate hain."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:126
msgid "Changing the look of a form never changes what it does with the information."
msgstr "Form ki dikhawat badalne se wo jaankari ka kya karta hai, ye kabhi nahi badalta."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:127
msgid "Start from one of the ready-made forms. They already ask for the right things and are set up correctly."
msgstr "Banaye-banaye form mein se ek se shuru kijiye. Wo pehle se sahi cheezein poochhte hain aur theek se lage hue hain."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:128
msgid "Every form sends what it collects to your Enquiries screen. You never have to check a separate inbox."
msgstr "Har form jo bhi jama karta hai wo aapki Enquiries screen par bhejta hai. Alag inbox dekhne ki zaroorat kabhi nahi padti."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:131
msgid "Every photo and document you have uploaded, in one place."
msgstr "Aapki chadhaayi hui har photo aur document, ek hi jagah."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:132
msgid "Drag files straight onto the page to upload them. Sort them by kind using the tabs."
msgstr "Files ko seedha page par khiskaakar upload kijiye. Tabs se unhe type ke hisaab se chhaant sakte hain."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:133
msgid "Deleting a file here removes it for good, and any property using it will lose that photo. Check before you delete."
msgstr "Yahan file delete karne se wo hamesha ke liye hat jaati hai, aur jis property mein lagi hai us se wo photo chali jayegi. Delete karne se pehle dekh lijiye."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:136
msgid "Blogs, articles and market insights — three kinds of writing, all on this one screen."
msgstr "Blog, article aur market insights — teen tarah ki likhawat, sab isi ek screen par."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:137
msgid "Use the tabs to switch between them. Each kind can have its own topics."
msgstr "Inke beech jaane ke liye tabs use kijiye. Har type ke apne topics ho sakte hain."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:138
msgid "Writing about your area is one of the cheapest ways to get found on Google."
msgstr "Apne area ke baare mein likhna Google par milne ke sabse saste tareekon mein se ek hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:141
msgid "Always run a test first. It checks your file without changing anything."
msgstr "Pehle hamesha test chalaiye. Wo aapki file ko bina kuch badle jaanchta hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:142
msgid "Give each row a reference number so importing the same file twice does not create copies."
msgstr "Har row ko ek reference number dijiye taaki wahi file do baar import karne par copy na banein."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:143
msgid "Imported properties always arrive as drafts, so you can check them before anything appears on your website."
msgstr "Import ki hui properties hamesha draft mein aati hain, taaki website par kuch dikhne se pehle aap unhe jaanch sakein."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:144
msgid "Download a sample file first and fill that in. It already has the right column names."
msgstr "Pehle sample file download karke usme bhariye. Usme sahi column ke naam pehle se hain."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:147
msgid "How your office is doing: enquiries coming in, visits arranged, and which team member is handling what."
msgstr "Aapka office kaisa chal raha hai: kitni enquiries aa rahi hain, kitni visits tay huin, aur kaunsa team member kya dekh raha hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:148
msgid "These numbers only reflect what has been recorded. If visits are not marked as done, they will not show here."
msgstr "Ye numbers sirf wahi dikhate hain jo darj hua hai. Agar visits ko \"pura hua\" nahi lagaya, to wo yahan nahi dikhengi."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:151
msgid "Fill in your office details first: name, phone and currency."
msgstr "Pehle apne office ki jaankari bhariye: naam, phone aur currency."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:152
msgid "Nothing here is deleted when you deactivate the plugin."
msgstr "Plugin band karne par yahan ka kuch bhi delete nahi hota."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:153
msgid "The Tools tab has the buttons for fixing things: rebuilding the property search, clearing stored copies, and creating practice records to experiment with."
msgstr "Tools tab mein cheezein theek karne ke button hain: property search dobara banana, rakhi hui copies hataana, aur aazmaane ke liye practice records banana."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:154
msgid "Your data is only ever deleted if you explicitly tick the box on the Tools tab. By default, uninstalling keeps everything."
msgstr "Aapka data tabhi delete hota hai jab aap Tools tab par khud box tick karein. Aam taur par plugin hataane par sab kuch rehta hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:157
msgid "Every field on this screen has a short explanation below it."
msgstr "Is screen ke har khaane ke neeche chhota sa samjhava diya hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:160
msgid "About this screen"
msgstr "Is screen ke baare me"

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:166
msgid "Information for support"
msgstr "Support ke liye jaankari"

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:167
msgid "If you ask for help, copy this. It contains no passwords or personal information."
msgstr "Madad maangte waqt ise copy kijiye. Isme koi password ya personal jaankari nahi hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:169
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Copy karein"

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:213
msgid "Saved. Your changes are stored."
msgstr "Save ho gaya. Aapke badlav rakh liye gaye hain."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:214
msgid "Published. This property is now live on your website for anyone to see."
msgstr "Website par daal diya. Ab ye property aapki website par sabko dikhegi."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:215
msgid "Saved as a draft. Only your office can see it — nobody on the website can."
msgstr "Draft mein save ho gaya. Ise sirf aapka office dekh sakta hai — website par kisi ko nahi dikhta."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:216
msgid "Removed. It is no longer in your office records."
msgstr "Hata diya. Ab ye aapke office ke record mein nahi hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:217
msgid "Moved to the bin. It is off your website, and you can put it back any time."
msgstr "Bin mein daal diya. Ab wo aapki website par nahi hai, aur jab chaahein wapas la sakte hain."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:218
msgid "Put back. It is saved as a draft, so check it over before you publish it again."
msgstr "Wapas aa gaya. Ye draft mein save hai, isliye dobara website par daalne se pehle dekh lijiye."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:219
msgid "Undone. The details are back to how they were before the last save. Whether it is on the website was left as it is."
msgstr "Undo ho gaya. Jaankari waisi ho gayi jaisi pichhle save se pehle thi. Website par hai ya nahi, wo waise ka waisa chhod diya gaya."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:220
msgid "All set. Your website pages are live — have a look at them below."
msgstr "Sab taiyaar. Aapki website ke page live hain — neeche dekh lijiye."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:221
msgid "Done. That team member is now responsible for this enquiry."
msgstr "Ho gaya. Ab ye enquiry us team member ke paas hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:222
msgid "Site visit booked. It will appear on your Today screen on the day."
msgstr "Site visit tay ho gayi. Us din wo aapki Today screen par dikhegi."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:223
msgid "The name, phone and email have been erased for good. The record of the enquiry itself is kept."
msgstr "Naam, phone aur email hamesha ke liye mit gaye. Enquiry ka record rakha gaya hai."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:224
msgid "Import finished. The new properties were saved as drafts so you can check them before publishing."
msgstr "Import pura hua. Nayi properties draft mein save huin taaki website par daalne se pehle aap unhe dekh sakein."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:225
msgid "Practice records have been created for you to try."
msgstr "Aazmaane ke liye practice records bana diye gaye hain."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:226
msgid "All practice records have been removed."
msgstr "Saare practice records hata diye gaye."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:227
msgid "The property search has been refreshed."
msgstr "Property search taaza kar di gayi."

#: includes/Admin/Screens/Partials.php:228
